               <p>
                  <span class="speaker">Ken:
                     </span>
                  Oh, yes.
                  </p>
               
               <p>
                  <span class="speaker">Momo:
                     </span>
                  I really thought I was gonna die!
                  </p>
               
               <p>
                  <span class="speaker">Ken:
                     </span>
                  Oh! Miss Ayase, the curse!
