                     </span>
                  But you made fun of it!
                  </p>
               
               <p>
                  <span class="speaker">Momo:
                     </span>
                  Huh? I'm kinda dizzy.
                  
                  Oh, crap.
                  </p>
               
               <p>
                  <span class="speaker">Ken:
                     </span>
                  Huh?
                  
                  Miss Ayase?
                  
                  Get a hold of yourself! Miss Ayase!
